abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization of the exact native real-to-C3 coordinate crosswalk,
  enriched TFVD and Green transport, camera-complete cutoff and head-tail
  identities, the Pythagorean branch-defect ledger, arithmetic nonlocal trace,
  and full-endpoint Poisson guardrails.
